    "visibleText": "2022 - PyCon HK - Page 2 Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Category: 2022 Sponsors – PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 July 20, 2025 PyCon Hong Kong 2022 sincerely thanks our sponsors for supporting our mission and making the Annual Conference possible! Please click on sponsor logos for further sponsor messages. Gold Sponsors AWS Microsoft Silver Sponsors MYSQL PCCW-HKT Read More Have a conversation with AWS at PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 July 20, 2025 About Amazon Web Services For over 15 years, Amazon Web Services has been the world’s most comprehensive and broadly adopted cloud offering. AWS has been continually expanding its services to support virtually any cloud workload, and it now has more than 200 fully featured services for compute, storage, databases, networking, analytics, machine learning and artificial… Read More Have a conversation with PCCW-HKT at PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 July 20, 2025 PCCW Limited (SEHK: 0008) is a global company headquartered in Hong Kong which holds interests in telecommunications, media, IT solutions, property development and investment, and other businesses. The Company holds a majority stake in the HKT Trust and HKT Limited. Read More Have a conversation with MySQL at PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 July 20, 2025 MySQL is the world’s most popular OS database. With its proven performance, reliability and ease-of-use, MySQL has become the leading database choice for web-based applications, used by high profile web properties including Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, Yahoo! and many more. Additionally, it is an extremely popular choice as embedded database, distributed by over 3,000 ISVs & OEMs. To organizations in need of an open source, ACID-compliant transactional database delivering real-time in-memory performance and 99.999 percent availability, Oracle offers MySQL Cluster. Read More Have a conversation with Microsoft at PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 July 20, 2025 Microsoft (Nasdaq “MSFT” @microsoft) enables digital transformation for the era of an intelligent cloud and an intelligent edge. Its mission is to empower every person and every organization on the planet to achieve more. Read More Volunteers – PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 October 15, 2022 Volunteers of PyCon Hong Kong 2022 (In alphabetical order): Arnold ChanCalvin Y.K. ChongClaire WongDaisy Maris FungFiona LamGordon ChoiHaggen SoHenry LawIvan IpJoe ChanKen ChiuKen ChuRonald HungSam ChiuSammy FungScotty KwokTing Ka KiTommy Han Read More PYCON HK 2022 Calls For Proposals is now open! Posted on August 17, 2022 July 20, 2025 PYCON HK physical conference is back! Our theme this year is “Delight Yourself in Python”, you are cordially invited to submit your proposed topics! Don’t miss this chance to speak to our python community in person! Conference Date: 29 Oct 2022 (SAT)Conference Venue: 8/F , The Hong Kong Federation of Youth Groups Building, 21 Pak… Read More Previous 1 2 Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! →"
