    "visibleText": "Schedule – PyCon HK 2022 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Schedule – PyCon HK 2022 Posted on October 30, 2022 July 20, 2025 November 5, 2022 (Saturday) Zoom Meeting https://us06web.zoom.us/j/83928780464?pwd=UmlTTmt2TGprRGEvWElMYnZ1RTZBZz09 Meeting ID: 839 2878 0464 Passcode: 997549 Time (UTC+8) Track 1 14:00 – 14:15 Opening 14:15 – 14:45 Triton As NLP Model Inference Back-end Mr. Ko Ko@Chatbot Developers 🇹🇼 /🎙English 15:00 – 15:30 Deep Learning with PyTorch: From Beginner to Research Mr. Ted Lu@Taiwan Open Education Develop Unit 🇹🇼 /🎙English 15:45 – 16:15 Introduction to Kedro – Building Data Pipeline with Python Mr. Nok Lam Chan@QuantumBlack 🇭🇰 /🎙English 16:45 – 17:00 Closing October 29, 2022 (Saturday) 8/F., The Hong Kong Federation of Youth Groups Building, 21 Pak Fuk Road, North Point, Hong Kong [ Google Map ] Time (UTC+8) Track 1 Track 2 09:00 – 10:00 Reception 10:00 – 10:15 Opening Sammy Fung 10:15 – 10:45 3D Visualization with Spatial Data for 5G Planning + Websites auto-tagging algorithm Dr. Chung Ng, Mr. Alex Zhang, Mr. Ho-Wa Wong@HKT ( PCCW ) 🇭🇰 /🎙English [👩‍🎓Track] A Journey to be a Python Angel Mr. Ka Tim Chu@Hong Kong True Light College / The Hong Kong Association for Computer Education 🇭🇰 /🎙Cantonese 11:00 – 11:30 What if…Python + Azure Mr. Eason Lai@Microsoft 🇭🇰 /🎙English Automation and Monitoring in WealthTech Ms. Rebecca Lim@AutoML Capital Limited 🇭🇰 /🎙English 11:45 – 12:15 Exploration of MySQL Operator for Kubernetes in Python Mr. Ivan Ma@Oracle ( MySQL ) 🇭🇰 /🎙English Airflow v2 – Using Airflow to manage ETL workflows Mr. MJ Tung@ActusRayPartners 🇭🇰 /🎙English 12:30 – 14:00 Lunch 14:00 – 14:30 Accelerate data preparation with Pandas and AWS Glue DataBrew Mr. Fortune Hui@AWS 🇭🇰 /🎙English Healthy Machine Learning: From Theory to Practice Mr. Warrington Hsu@ComboKid 🇭🇰 /🎙Cantonese 14:45 – 15:15 Taking machine learning models to production using Python and FastAPI Mr. Utkarsh Goel@Deploifai 🇭🇰 /🎙English Managing R and MATLAB GUI environments in Jupyter Dr. Vinci Chow@CUHK ( Department of Economics ) 🇭🇰 /🎙English 15:30 – 15:45 Break 15:45 – 16:15 How Python is applying in Architecture, Engineering & Construction Industry Mr. Cho Ka Chun@Osarch 🇭🇰 /🎙Cantonese Healthcare by a Pythonista Ms. Shilpa Karkeraa@Myraa Technologies 🇸🇬 /🎙English 16:30 – 17:00 Django Apps at Scale: Mistakes to Avoid Kushal Vijay@Microsoft 🇮🇳 /🎙English 17:15 – 17:30 Closing Sammy Fung 17:35 Happy Hour Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← [PyCon HK x COSCUP 2022 Online Special Track] Introduction to Kedro – Building Data Pipeline with Python ← PyCon HK 2022 Photos"
