    "visibleText": "Ticket – PyCon Hong Kong 2022 - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Ticket – PyCon Hong Kong 2022 Posted on October 1, 2022 July 20, 2025 November 5, 2022 PyCon HK x COSCUP 2022 Online Special Track Free of Charge. October 29, 2022 PyCon HK Physical Conference PYCON HK physical conference is back! Our theme this year is “Delight Yourself in Python”, Don’t miss this chance to meet others in person. Tickets are on sale now. Multiple promotional offers are available from HK$148-498 Sponsor ticket that includes a T-shirt and other goodies. Remark: In case of any situation that does not allow in-person conferencing, it will be changed to an online conference. Following the HKSARG’s implementation of Vaccine Pass, all visitors to the PyCon Hong Kong 2022 will be required to show their COVID-19 vaccination record before entering. For more information about the requirement, please refer to the HKSAR website . GET TICKET NOW! SCHEDULE Ticket Type Price Sales End Academics HK$148.00 October 29, 2022 PySupporter HK$498.00 October 29, 2022 PyConference HK$398.00 October 29, 2022 Financial Assistance Program HK$0.00 October 29, 2022 PySupporter ( Early Bird ) HK$398.00 October 6, 2022 PyConference ( Early Bird ) HK$298.00 October 6, 2022 Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← Accelerate data preparation with Pandas and AWS Glue DataBrew ← [PyCon HK x COSCUP 2022 Online Special Track] Triton As NLP Model Inference Back-end"
