    "visibleText": "Education Track | A Journey to be a Python Angel - PyCon HK Skip to content Menu PyCon HK Conference Highlights Schedule 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2020 Spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 Sponsors 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 Communities 2024 2023 2022 Booths 2024 2023 Organizers 2024 2023 2022 Volunteers 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Fall 2018 2017 2016 2015 PyCon HK Education Track | A Journey to be a Python Angel Posted on October 1, 2022 October 7, 2022 Our sharing will share the practical experiences on curriculum planning, lesson implementation, assessment and resources used in Python teaching. We develop a school-based Python curriculum in S3 to build up students’ computational thinking through different pedagogies. Different types of assessments are also carried out to measure students’ competence and standard on Python learning. To keep the momentum of learning Python programming, we use an online self-directed learning platform to engage and keep track of their learning. Date and Time : October 29, 2022 / 10:15-10:45 ( UTC+8 ) Language : Cantonese Speaker : Mr. Ka Tim Chu / Hong Kong True Light College / The Hong Kong Association for Computer Education / Hong Kong Speaker Introduction Mr. Ka Tim Chu Ka Tim Chu is the vice-principal of Hong Kong True Light College and the chairman of the Hong Kong Association for Computer Education. He is passionate about ICT, coding, e-learning and STEM. In addition to nearly 20 years of experience in the school sector, he organises a lot of activities to empower students, especially girls to learn coding and STEM education. He is an award-winning teacher including Outstanding IT Teacher award and teaching award on information literacy and led his school teams to win several International Outstanding E-learning Awards for STEM, Coding and Computational Thinking. Instagram LinkedIn Facebook Twitter YouTube Search for: Archives Archives Select Month November 2024 October 2024 September 2024 July 2024 April 2024 December 2023 October 2023 September 2023 July 2023 April 2023 November 2022 October 2022 August 2022 October 2021 September 2021 May 2021 November 2020 October 2020 September 2020 May 2020 April 2020 November 2018 October 2018 September 2018 August 2018 November 2017 October 2016 November 2015 History 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020-fall 2020-spring 2018 2017 2016 2015 ©2026 PyCon HK | Powered by SuperbThemes! ← 3D Visualization with Spatial Data for 5G Planning + Websites auto-tagging algorithm ← Automation and Monitoring in WealthTech"
